      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 233]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Weekend)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "The weekend is my most favorite part of the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "On Saturdays, we only go to school in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes if there is a special day like a birthday party,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "we celebrate on Saturday afternoons."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We like to go to the karaoke room for these."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Our family often visits the house of my father’s friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We sometimes visit our relatives or they come to our house."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I wish every day could be like the weekend."
    },
